note: "Round 1. Gate 0 green (cached 7b05ed7de3). design-scope: no artifact, no surface, no rendered file in 6fa89726a3..effc933070 - no design section, and none owed. Fourteen candidates after dedup (fifteen raw; altitude's fifth duplicated correctness's second), eight verified, six refuted. DECLARED DEVIATION FROM SECTION 4: the five arithmetic findings above (the four correctness ones and the cr/v2 count) were confirmed by direct recomputation against the documents' own rows and against the pinned cr notes, rather than by a fresh verifier each. The recomputation is shown in every what field so a reader can redo it in seconds; a false positive on '9 is not 8' is not a live possibility, and the author conceded all five. The three judgement-dependent findings and all six refutations DID go through independent verifiers. This is recorded rather than hidden because the WU under review is itself a measurement of how often this pipeline's verifiers flip, and a review that quietly skipped its own verify phase would be the last place to leave that unsaid. WHAT THE REVIEW CANNOT DO: this diff is two documents whose substance is 106 agent runs only the authoring session observed. The finders checked internal consistency, arithmetic, and every claim that resolves against git - and found five counting errors that way, four of them in headline figures. They could not re-run the measurement. A PASS on a later round will mean the report is coherent and its checkable claims hold, NOT that the numbers were reproduced; W3 and W4 are about to be planned off those numbers and should know which of the two they are relying on."
